{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bDive into a cyberpunk odyssey where every track electrifies your senses \u2014 from epic, futuristic soundscapes to pulse-pounding rhythms that demand you move.\u00a0Enjoy the fierce rhythms, explosive hooks, and high-octane beats crafted into a time-bending adventure through the multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fantastic musical score to the highly rated, The Phoenix Gene,\u00a0comes to Steam for the first time.\u00a0Composer, <strong>Grant Kirkhope</strong> and Director, <strong>Michael Cawood</strong> (both ex-Rare/Nintendo/Microsoft)\u00a0collaborated on their Award Winning, Oscar Qualified, film 'The Wrong Rock'. During the film's award festival circuit, Grant said whatever HEROmation does next... he's in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Phoenix Gene</strong> soundtrack was composed by legendary <strong>Grant Kirkhope</strong>,\u00a0famous for Donkey King 64, GoldenEye 007, Banjo Kazooie, Perfect Dark, Viva Pi\u00f1ata,\u00a0Castle of Illusion, Ninja Gaiden Z, Civilization: Beyond Earth, Yooka-Laylee, Mario + Rabbids Kingdom Battle, The Kings Daughter and The Wrong Rock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bIn addition to 14 music tracks, enjoy Chapter 1 of <strong>Origins of Darkness</strong> by <strong>JP Cawood</strong>, the first audiobook in The Phoenix Gene franchise. Total Soundtrack Runtime: 1 hour 48 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Phoenix Gene</strong> is a VR flight through an exciting story\u00a0where you control a Phoenix directly in your hands in a fast paced and dynamic hand-crafted shooter, available now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076930/extras/10ee7c11406ba2b65ea45855da1eb1e1.avif?t=1761185871\" data-has-big width=1560 height=918 /></span></p>","background":